{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "3c87412c7794c504e0fc9247db831bc5b4dff8965d47679d308fb6b91c260517", "ja": "舞台裏にて　～それぞれの熱意～", "zh": "后台幕后 ～各自的热情～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "953ad322cf1f62e07a39492214a3eee588248c835c1cad87784cfbddf9d9db91", "ja": "待機中、会場の盛り上がりにウズウズする海\n美、昴、瑞希。真美が意気込みを問うと、そ\nれぞれ熱意たっぷりの答えが返ってくる。気\n合いは十分、後は出番を待つばかり！", "zh": "候场期间，海美、昴和瑞希因为会场的热烈\n气氛而跃跃欲试。真美向她们询问干劲时，\n每个人都给出了热情满满的回答。干劲已经\n十分充足，接下来就只等登场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1000_audience", "source_sha256": "9f9404d5e94fcf78798a24d440968e5d5f0f8815f497d211f3a3fa92514c1545", "ja": "ワアアアアアアアア！", "zh": "哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "f39b9ba7309ab7639f86df381f1a013ede819ac4e1b036fb7eb4407e1749d5c8", "ja": "会場、すっげー盛り上がってるみたいだな！\nううっ、オレも早くステージに上がりたいぜ……！", "zh": "会场好像热闹得不得了啊！\n呜呜，我也想快点登上舞台……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "556e08dd9b183c3467f0e7326dbef5143859c1473bbbf7234c6cc3a2574b45ca", "ja": "私も、すばるんと同じ気持ちだよ！　今すぐ\nステージに上がりたくて、ウズウズしちゃうーっ！", "zh": "我也是和昴昴一样的心情！现在就想登上舞台，已经迫不及待啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "7eb8281664f2aea2f2521c864b333e0920c89a158d3e79e1e8380e12f0f6376d", "ja": "みなさん、気合い十分のようですね。\nかくいう私も、準備万端です。……やるぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "大家看起来都干劲十足呢。\n我也一样，已经准备万全了。……加油啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "873115b14ffb645766717093bf666d5a58faaabbe927d6f3cb848a2b82c54036", "ja": "ほほう……。みんな、やる気ですなぁ。\nんじゃ、ここでみんなの意気込みを教えてもらおうか！", "zh": "哦哦……大家似乎都干劲十足嘛。\n那么，就请大家告诉我你们的决心吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "0d4d9b6ae90fa82cc35a5db22624ebbc8f4b25a3fbd4dc8aa89c58855149428c", "ja": "私は、「もう無理！　立てない！」ってなるくらい、\n全力で歌って踊りたいな！　準備運動もバッチリだし♪", "zh": "我想全力唱歌跳舞，直到变成“已经不行了！站不起来了！”的程度！热身运动也做得很充分了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1006_047sub", "source_sha256": "88a9475a9ab28e4bd0c7b208ea457e942484bb779492ffb6a3ffbed899052087", "ja": "オレもオレも！　せっかく大きい会場だし、\n場外ホームラン級のステージにしたいよな！", "zh": "我也是我也是！难得是在这么大的会场，当然要办一场打出场外全垒打级别的演出啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "5b7419029a1340c9424d0c1a4fe4b5228ddc8693b3b52f570fd5fcfb564f105d", "ja": "ふむふむ、これは真美も負けていられませんなぁ。\nそれじゃあ……最後はみずきん！", "zh": "嗯嗯，真美也不能输给大家呀。\n那么……最后是瑞希！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "6d5b458538de64eb23a8d98f6177a122586f2080ed10177da4145af9005eddfa", "ja": "はい。今日は特別なライブなので……いつもとは\n違う瑞希を、ファンのみなさんにお届けできればと。", "zh": "是的。因为今天是特别的演唱会……希望能让各位粉丝看到与平时不同的瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "57f8774c228b46c989774946d3aad37bbe5b634b98f57bab33547c2bf5ab5a4d", "ja": "いつもとは違うみずきん……！　へーっ、面白そう！\nでも、どんな感じで違うのかな？", "zh": "和平时不一样的瑞希……！诶～感觉很有意思呢！\n不过，是怎样一个不一样法呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "5d05007ad63a5d5eb89ab766807104aec20350ac5139a3375d039ba98beba897", "ja": "そうですね。今日は、いつもより熱い……\nスペシャルな私を、お届けしたいと思っています。", "zh": "是啊。今天我想为大家带来比平时更加热情的……\n特别的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "3cf9f49ff21aa7db0b4bb6cf3a0bf8e4c49ff36428ee4748df17ed1c202c64cf", "ja": "スペシャルなみずきんか～。んじゃ、\nうみみんも昴くんも、スペシャルな感じで！", "zh": "特别的水晶酱啊～。那，  \n海美美和昴昴也要拿出特别的感觉来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1012_047sub", "source_sha256": "079becf63bdd4bc843862524e3e32a0c2437255ce8b2cf1ce2f5c93beb0b043d", "ja": "ていうか、真美の意気込みはないのか？\nオレたちみんな言ったんだし、教えてくれよ！", "zh": "话说，真美你就没有什么干劲宣言吗？\n既然我们大家都说了，就告诉我们吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "3d88db8af78d3a421c6432dbc20bf0affb373f84431608f4db42b1c66e14d7c6", "ja": "え？　ネタばらししちゃったらつまんなくない？\nってワケで、真美の必殺技は本番でのお楽しみ～！", "zh": "诶？要是现在就把梗揭穿了，不就没意思了吗？\n所以说，真美的必杀技就留到正式演出时再揭晓啦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1014_047sub", "source_sha256": "c28f5cb8f951aacb7afbd117d0173a01e551fe9a29a7a3f500803566f0f1f9e0", "ja": "えーっ、そう言われるとなんか気になるんだけど……\nま、いっか。本番で、みんなを驚かせてやるぜ！", "zh": "诶——你这么一说，我反而有点在意了……\n嘛，也行吧。正式演出时，就让大家大吃一惊吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "8fde3eec75106c76248b6bb05a39d7d2d6b9ef3b73f594aeb53eaa1fa1f2bf23", "ja": "うんっ！　お客さんたちの勢いに負けないぐらい、\nみんなで思いっきり盛り上げようね！", "zh": "嗯！大家一起尽情热闹起来，气势可不能输给客人们哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0142_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0142_story_05_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "5eee9058e37b5105b0fde83403a39d4e01e30852b7c57b261cd9fea562e57fa3", "ja": "はい。それでは、張りきっていきましょう。\n……えいえい、おー。", "zh": "好的。那么，我们一起全力以赴吧。\n……加油，加油，哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
